# 3x3 piston door, v1. 14 wide (x), 4 deep (z), 6 tall. door is row z=1, doorway is x=6..8.
# left side: 2 slime columns (a slab) moved 2 steps by a relay. P1 (row 2) pushes the slab 1 step,
# then P2 (sits on top of the slab, rides along) pushes a slime tab 1 more step.
# right side: 1 honey column pulled/pushed by one sticky piston.
# obsidian everywhere slime/honey touches the wall (immovable = ignored, stone would get glued on).
# MANUAL sequencing, 3 levers:
#   CLOSE: west-end lever ON, wait a second, top-back lever ON, east-end lever ON
#   OPEN:  top-back lever OFF, wait a second, west-end lever OFF, east-end lever OFF
palette:
O obsidian
S smooth_stone
Y slime_block
H honey_block
E sticky_piston[facing=east]
W sticky_piston[facing=west]
D redstone_wire
l lever[face=wall,facing=west,powered=false]
r lever[face=wall,facing=east,powered=false]
f lever[face=floor,facing=north,powered=false]

layer 0
SSSSSSSSSSSSSS
SSSOOOOOOOOSSS
SSSSSSSSSSSSSS
SSSSSSSSSSSSSS

